                            <comment id="15234843" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 11 Apr 2016 10:26:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Allowing constants within compiled query will unnecessarily complicate compilation.&lt;br/&gt;
This should not be a problem for users (rare use case, easy workaround). &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;ve fixed validation check for zero and one arg compiled queries, so the exception is &quot;Error compiling query: all compiled query arguments should come from enclosing delegate&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
